+## Phase 5 competitive match intelligence
+
+The playable match now includes a deterministic competitive director around the existing human, physics, audio and living-world systems:
+
+- correct throw-ins, corners, goal kicks, kick-offs, direct and indirect free kicks, penalties and dropped-ball foundations;
+- pass-time offside candidates that are penalized only when the player becomes actively involved;
+- referee profiles controlling strictness, advantage, cards, penalties and VAR intervention;
+- advantage continuation and recall, disciplinary records and stoppage-time calculation;
+- goal, penalty, direct-red, mistaken-identity and offside VAR review states;
+- fourteen selectable set-piece routines and six tactical presets affecting line height, width, compactness, pressing and restart positioning;
+- visible referee crews, assistant flags, offside training lines, restart markers and stadium VAR presentation;
+- authoritative competitive snapshots for ball, clock, score, offside, fouls, cards, VAR and restarts;
+- nine registered GLTF/FBX/KTX2/Basis asset slots with licensing checks and guaranteed procedural fallback.
+
+Run `npm run phase5:validate` to validate the laws, tactics, referee, set-piece, VAR, networking and asset-ingestion manifests. External scanned athletes, professional mocap and licensed PBR packs are not bundled; the repository provides the ingestion contract and safe fallback pipeline.
